        " is a nonempty list of strings or ", 
        Cell[BoxData[ButtonBox["OverBar", BaseStyle -> "Link", 
           ButtonData -> "paclet:ref/OverBar"]], "InlineFormula", 
         FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], " expressions."}], "Notes", 
      CellID -> 961502512], Cell[TextData[{"With one label per marker except \
the terminal marker, only the actual initial and internal vertices are \
labelled. With one label per marker, the terminal label is placed on the last \
available sample, one index before the omitted terminal vertex."}], "Notes", 
      CellID -> 1256073293], 
     Cell[TextData[{"Additional arguments and options for ", 
